SUMMARY:Belgium: "Loon-datatransfer" tool to replace DmfA
DESCRIPTION:Upcoming\, 1 Jan 2027 (Voluntary from 2027). As part of RSZ's e
 -gov modernisation\, a new "loon-datatransfer" (wage data transfer) tool w
 ill be available for voluntary use and testing from 1 January 2027\, becom
 e mandatory from 1 January 2028\, and the DmfA submission itself will be a
 bolished from 1 January 2030. RSZ began sending informational letters to e
 mployers about the transition from 28 May 2026.\n\nSource: https://www.uni
 zo.be/berichten/nieuws/informatiebrieven-rsz\nDetails: https://www.intelli
 gentpayroll.eu/countries/belgium.html#be-reporting-upcoming\n\nFor informa
 tion only\, not legal or tax advice. Sources last checked 1 October 2026.
